;; world/rooms/wrongwater/x0y7.room
(room
  region: wrongwater
  at: (0 7)
  title: "The Long Drop"
  intent: "above the highest water a dry shelf ends at a long drop, and the violet note you can hear is somewhere below"
  bed: (air 0.15 water 0.3 hang 0.6 drone 0.6)
  light: 0.6
  grid:
  ("#########################"
   "########         ########"
   "                 ########"
   "                    #####"
   "#############       #####"
   "#############       #####"
   "#############       #####"
   "#############       #####"
   "#############       #####"
   "#############       #####"
   "#############       #####")
  decor: auto)
;; The shelf from the tarn (standing row 3) runs east under a raised roof
;; to a lip over a shaft seven wide (13-19) that drops through the whole
;; room into the Way Out: one way, too wide to kick up and with no rough
;; rock. H7 used to wait here; it moved to the Drowned Grove (David, after
;; the expansion demo: too near the way in), and its tone, heard from here,
;; comes from below. Back west, the shelf leads to the tarn's top: drop in
;; and sink out of its bottom.
